config BR2_PACKAGE_TAQ102_DISPLAY
	bool "taq102-display (LVDS video PHY module and its loader)"
	help
	  The rockchip-inno video combo PHY driver built as a module from our
	  4.4.167 tree, plus the script /init runs to load it before anything
	  draws. Built into the kernel the driver hangs the boot at the PHY's
	  first power-on, before any console exists; loaded after /init has a
	  console it brings the display up in a second.
